\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces How much policy separation survives held-trace readout. Spread is the mean absolute pairwise difference in per-problem accuracy (max\,--\,min is unstable at three or four presses). The \emph  {difference} carries the interval; the ratio is descriptive, because at the saturated end its denominator approaches zero. Rank agreement counts press pairs ordered alike by both protocols. \textbf  {Post-hoc and exploratory} (Amendment L).}}{11}{table.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
